---
const rooms=[["BUSINESS","Talks in capabilities","Improve onboarding time · Improve pilot conversion"],["PRODUCT / BA","Talks in requirements","PRD · Review Symbols v2 · DRAFT"],["ENGINEERING","Talks in repositories","SymbolClassifierService.ts · DrawingConversionService.ts"]];
const agents=[["PRD","PRD Agent","Turns product intent into a reviewable requirement from shared context."],["BRF","Brief Agent","Produces an engineering brief with affected entities attached."],["IMP","Impact Agent","Prices change as a blast radius with evidence."],["DOC","Docs Agent","Rewrites documentation from the model as a reviewable diff."]];
const audiences=[["Business and product","Reads product state and cost of change without reading code."],["Business analysts","Turns a request into a specified change with evidence attached."],["Engineering","Enters the IDE knowing what to change, what it touches, and what to test."]];
---
<section class="home_hero_section is-first-section">
  <div class="home_hero_div"><h1 class="home_hero_h1"><span>Code ships fast now.</span><br/><span>Products still don't.</span></h1><div class="home_hero_div-2"><p>AI made teams faster. Handoffs became the bottleneck.</p><p>Interfluent gives business, product, and engineering one shared understanding of the system and AI agents that can reason, coordinate, and act across it.</p><p>Instead of isolated productivity gains, Interfluent makes the whole organization compound.</p></div><div class="home_hero_div-3"><a href="#cta" class="home_hero_a">Book a walkthrough</a><a href="#today" class="home_hero_a-2">Read the story ↓</a></div></div>
  <div class="rs-heroviz home_hero_div-4"><div class="home_hero_div-6"><div class="home_hero_div-7"><span>CODE</span><span>47 changes today</span></div><div class="home-native-stream"><span>feat: symbol classifier v2</span><span>fix: pdf raster memory</span><span>feat: line-type review</span><span>refactor: graph export</span></div><div class="rs-gap home_hero_div-12"><div>Which feature does this touch?</div><div>What will it cost?</div><div>Is the documentation still true?</div></div><div class="home_hero_div-18"><span>PRODUCT</span><span>1 capability this quarter</span></div></div></div>
</section>

<section id="today" class="home_act-1-today_section"><div class="home_act-1-today_div"><div class="home_act-1-today_div-2">01 · TODAY</div><h2 class="home_act-1-today_h2">Three rooms. Three languages. One system nobody can see whole.</h2><p class="home_act-1-today_p">Every planning conversation starts by redrawing the map by hand, and the map is stale by the time the meeting ends.</p></div><div class="home_act-1-today_div-3">{rooms.map(([k,n,d])=><article class="home-native-card"><div class="home-native-label">{k}</div><h3>{n}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></section>

<section id="context" class="home_act-2-shared-context_section"><div class="home-native-context"><div><div class="home_act-2-shared-context_div-4">02 · WHAT SHIPPING WELL NEEDS</div><h2 class="home_act-2-shared-context_h2">One picture of the system that all three rooms can read.</h2><p>Capabilities, requirements, documentation, code and tests belong in one connected model.</p></div><div class="home-native-model"><div>PRODUCT CAPABILITIES</div><div>REQUIREMENTS + DOCS</div><div>CODE + TESTS</div><strong>ONE CONNECTED MODEL</strong></div></div></section>

<section id="codelens" class="home_act-3-interfluent_section"><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div"><div class="home_act-3-interfluent_div-2">03 · INTERFLUENT</div><h2 class="home_act-3-interfluent_h2">Interfluent is that shared context. And the agents that work from it.</h2><p class="home_act-3-interfluent_p">Every node carries what the agents currently know about it.</p></div><div class="home-native-app"><aside>Pulse<br/>Canvas<br/>Context Graph<br/>PRDs<br/>Impact Analysis<br/>Technical Debt<br/>Security<br/>Test Planning</aside><div><h3>Product feature map</h3><div class="home-native-feature-grid">{["Convert drawings","Review symbols","Classify unknowns","Export graph","Sync docs","Test planning"].map(x=><div>{x}</div>)}</div></div></div></section>

<section class="home_act-3-impact_section"><div><div class="home_act-3-impact_div">PRICE THE CHANGE FIRST</div><h3 class="home_act-3-impact_h3">Describe the change in a sentence. Get the blast radius back before anyone promises a date.</h3><p class="home_act-3-impact_p">Scope becomes evidence rather than a score to argue with.</p></div><div class="home-native-card"><strong>IMPACT ANALYSIS</strong><h3>Add DXF support to Review Symbols</h3><p>Medium change · 14 files · 6 tests · 3 documents to update</p></div></section>

<section class="home_act-3-agents_section"><div class="home_act-3-agents_div"><div><div class="home_act-3-agents_div-3">THE AGENT SUITE</div><h3 class="home_act-3-agents_h3">Agents that read from the model and write back into it.</h3></div></div><div class="home_act-3-agents_div-4">{agents.map(([k,n,d])=><article class="home-native-card"><div class="home-native-agent-key">{k}</div><h3>{n}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></section>

<section class="home_docs-sync_section"><div class="home_docs-sync_div"><div class="home-native-card"><strong>USER DOCUMENTATION · OUT OF SYNC</strong><p class="home-native-remove">- Files are parsed by the legacy DXF parser</p><p class="home-native-add">+ Files are routed through DrawingConversionService</p><p class="home-native-add">+ Unrecognised symbols are queued for classification</p></div><div><div class="home_docs-sync_div-8">THE RECORD STAYS TRUE</div><h3 class="home_docs-sync_h3">Documentation is rewritten when the system moves, and held as a diff until a human accepts it.</h3></div></div></section>

<section class="home_risk-by-capability_section"><div><div class="home_risk-by-capability_div">RISK, IN THE BUSINESS'S LANGUAGE</div><h3 class="home_risk-by-capability_h3">Debt, vulnerabilities and thin coverage, expressed as capabilities rather than files.</h3></div><div class="home-native-risk-list">{["Plant360 Convert","PDF/Image Conversion","Review Symbols","DWG/DXF Conversion","Mark Unidentified"].map((x,i)=><div><span>{x}</span><div><i style={`width:${70-i*9}%`}></i></div></div>)}</div></section>

<section class="home_test-plans_section"><div class="home_test-plans_div"><div class="home_test-plans_div-2">A GAP BECOMES A PLAN</div><h3 class="home_test-plans_h3">Any weak capability turns into a drafted test plan from the row that flagged it.</h3></div><div class="home-native-two-col"><div class="home-native-card"><strong>TEST COVERAGE · FLAGGED</strong><h3>Mark Unidentified Symbols</h3><p>44% coverage</p></div><div class="home-native-card"><strong>TEST PLAN · DRAFT</strong><p>□ Unrecognised symbol is queued, not dropped</p><p>□ Queue survives a conversion restart</p><p>□ Manual mark round-trips into the classifier</p></div></div></section>

<section class="home_audiences_section"><div class="home_audiences_div"><div class="home_audiences_div-2"><div class="home_audiences_div-3">WHO IT PAYS OFF FOR</div><h3 class="home_audiences_h3">Three audiences, one model, different reads.</h3></div><div class="home_audiences_div-4">{audiences.map(([n,d])=><article class="home-native-dark-card"><h3>{n}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>

<section class="home_where-it-sits_section"><div class="home_where-it-sits_div"><div class="home_where-it-sits_div-2">WHERE IT SITS</div><h3 class="home_where-it-sits_h3">It wraps the IDE rather than competing with it.</h3><p class="home_where-it-sits_p">Nothing is displaced. Interfluent decides and governs the change; the developer's IDE still writes it.</p></div><div class="rs-grid4 home_where-it-sits_div-3">{["INTENT","INTERFLUENT · DECIDE","EXECUTE","INTERFLUENT · GOVERN"].map(x=><div class="home-native-card"><strong>{x}</strong></div>)}</div></section>

<section class="home_differentiation_section"><div class="home_differentiation_div"><div class="home_differentiation_div-2"><div class="home_differentiation_div-3">WHAT YOU ALREADY OWN, AND WHAT IS MISSING</div><h3 class="home_differentiation_h3">Your current tools are good at their job. Interfluent holds the part in between.</h3></div><div class="home-native-diff">{["AI coding assistants","Code intelligence platforms","Quality and security tools","Documentation tooling"].map(x=><div><strong>{x}</strong><span>Existing tool capability</span><span>Shared context across intent, code and documentation</span></div>)}</div></div></section>

<section class="home_social-proof_section"><div class="home_social-proof_div">TEAMS BUILDING ON A SHARED PICTURE</div><div class="home_social-proof_div-2">{Array.from({length:6}).map(()=> <div class="home_social-proof_div-3">customer logo</div>)}</div></section>
<section id="cta" class="home_cta_section"><div class="home_cta_div"><div class="home_cta_div-2"><h3 class="home_cta_h3">See the whole loop on your own codebase.</h3><p class="home_cta_p">We'll walk it live, from feature map to test plan.</p></div><div class="home_cta_div-3"><a href="/contact/" class="home_cta_a">Book a walkthrough</a><a href="/beta/" class="home_cta_a-2">Request beta access</a></div></div></section>

<style>
.home-native-card{background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
.home-native-label,.home-native-agent-key{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:12px}
.home-native-stream{display:grid;gap:10px;padding:24px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13px}
.home-native-context{width:min(var(--site-content-width),calc(100% - (var(--page-padding)*2)));margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:48px;padding:96px 0}
.home-native-model{min-height:420px;border:1px solid rgba(246,243,236,.2);border-radius:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--color-bg)}
.home-native-model>div{padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(246,243,236,.1)}.home-native-model strong{color:var(--color-accent)}
.home-native-app{margin-top:56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
.home-native-app aside{padding:24px;border-right:1px solid var(--color-border);line-height:2}.home-native-app>div{padding:24px}.home-native-feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.home-native-feature-grid>div{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:10px}
.home-native-remove{background:#f4d9d1;color:#8a3a26;text-decoration:line-through;padding:6px}.home-native-add{background:#d9e6df;color:var(--color-primary);padding:6px}
.home-native-risk-list{display:grid;gap:14px}.home-native-risk-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:180px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center}.home-native-risk-list div div{height:12px;background:var(--color-surface-soft);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden}.home-native-risk-list i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--color-primary)}
.home-native-two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.home-native-dark-card{border:1px solid rgba(246,243,236,.18);border-radius:18px;padding:28px 26px}.home-native-diff>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr 1.6fr;gap:20px;padding:20px 22px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);background:var(--color-surface)}
@media(max-width:767px){.home-native-context,.home-native-app,.home-native-two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}.home-native-app aside{display:none}.home-native-feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.home-native-risk-list>div,.home-native-diff>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>